// An overloaded wood beam fails by stress: a long span under a deep sand pile cracks, breaks
// into loose wooden debris and drops; it doesn't hang in the air or vanish.
map
#########################################
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb####
#..................................######
#..................................######
#..................................######
#..@...............................######
#########################################
end
expect 1 static:WoodBeam == 34
expect 300 static:WoodBeam <= 3          // only the two end tiles resting on the granite ledge remain (and a sliver at finer cells)
expect 300 is:10,0,WoodBeam == 1         // wooden debris lies on the floor
expect 300 count:WoodBeam >= 20
expect 300 count:Sand >= 150
